WEBVTT

00:00:00.624 --> 00:00:01.304
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.268 --> 00:00:05.407
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Or I click to the middle of a film and watch a few minutes…

00:00:07.358 --> 00:00:07.999
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:12.741
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> We send voice notes to each other because it’s quicker than texting…

00:00:14.705 --> 00:00:15.487
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:16.389 --> 00:00:19.695
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> …the songs they feature are often played at double speed.

00:00:21.649 --> 00:00:22.358
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:23.282 --> 00:00:24.470
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> …it’s true that my friends

00:00:24.471 --> 00:00:27.994
and I live life at a faster pace compared to our parents.

00:00:29.937 --> 00:00:30.708
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:31.627 --> 00:00:34.279
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> But it’s nothing compared to the younger generation –

00:00:34.487 --> 00:00:37.020
their attention span is even shorter.